               5                     !
               6                     ! initialize some constant variable/arrays for ndsl advection -hmhj
               7                     !
               8                     ! program log
               9                     ! 2011 02 20 : henry jaung, initiated for ndsl advection
              10                     ! 2013 06 20 : henry jaung, enhance cyclic condition for extra strong wind in wam
